# Optional tuning; no secrets belong in this file.
CHATGPT_WINDOW_RE=ChatGPT
CHATGPT_PROCESS_RE=(?i)^ChatGPT(?:\.App| Desktop)?\.exe$
REMOTE_COMPOSER_X=0.50
REMOTE_COMPOSER_Y=0.88
REMOTE_ALLOW_COORDINATE_INPUT=0
REMOTE_LOCAL_HINT_RE=(?i)local|로컬|this computer|이 컴퓨터|on this device
REMOTE_NEW_CHAT_RE=(?i)new (chat|work|thread)|새 (채팅|대화)|new conversation
